3	//
4	// Plain server-side module. Every branch calls the SAME ownership-checked,
5	// rate-limited server action the button would have called, so connecting can
6	// never do more than the customer could do themselves; the intent only decides
7	// WHICH of their own records we publish. Result flags are folded into the
8	// redirect back to the page they started on.
